# @hub-lanes

# ── HOTSPOT-SPLIT-TICKET LANE (BH-6739, BH-6543.2) ───────────────────────────
# Weekly, Monday 04:53Z, after the Sunday conflict-hotspots measure. Reads the
# stored conflict-hotspots measurement (GET /api/conflict-hotspots, top 10, as
# PUT by the box that owns the checkout) and files ONE ai-build "Split <path>"
# issue for each file at or over
# the settings row hotspots.split_threshold (10) that is not in
# catalog/list-files.tsv and has no hotspot_tickets row. One summary line in
# logs/hotspot-split-ticket.log.
# Off: flags/lane-off-hotspot-split-ticket (bin/harness-ctl.sh off hotspot-split-ticket).
53 4 * * 1 /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/hotspot-split-ticket.sh >> /root/harness/logs/hotspot-split-ticket-cron.log 2>&1
